  "filter-to-selection": "Sivim bilong soim ol samting yu makim tasol",
  "other-filters-label": "Ol arapela samting bilong sivim",
  "advanced-filter-label": "Sivim wantaim moa mak",
  "advanced-filter-description": "Long sivim wantaim moa mak, yu ken raitim tok i gat ol dispela mak bilong wok: == != <= >= && || ( ) Putim spes namel long ol mak bilong wok. Yu ken sivim long olgeta kastam fil taim yu raitim nem na veliu bilong ol. Eksampel: Field1 == Value1. Tingim: Sapos nem bilong fil o veliu i gat spes, putim insait long ol singel mak bilong toktok. Eksampel: 'Field 1' == 'Value 1'. Bilong ol wanwan mak bilong bosim (' \\/) i no mekim wok bilong ol, yu ken yusim \\. Eksampel: Field1 == I\\'m. Yu ken bungim planti samting bilong sekim tu. Eksampel: F1 == V1 || F1 == V2. Ol mak bilong wok i save wok long han kais i go long han sut. Yu ken senisim oda taim yu putim ol braket. Eksampel: F1 == V1 && ( F2 == V2 || F2 == V3 ). Yu ken painim ol fil bilong teks wantaim regex tu: F1 == /Tes.*/i",
  "fullname": "Pulap nem",
  "header-logo-title": "Go bek long pes bilong ol bot bilong yu.",
  "show-activities": "Soim ol wok",
  "headerBarCreateBoardPopup-title": "Wokim wanpela bot",
  "home": "Haus",
  "import": "Bringim i kam",
  "impersonate-user": "Kisim ples bilong yusa",
  "link": "Link bilong web",
  "import-board": "Kisim i kam bot",
  "import-board-c": "Kisim i kam bot",
  "import-board-instruction-kanboard": "Putim kopi bilong Kanboard JSON ol i salim i go aut: wanpela objek i gat \"columns\" (o ol wok i gat column_name) na wanpela \"tasks\" array (title, description, column_name, swimlane_name, date_due, owner, tags). Ol column i kamap ol lis na ol wok i kamap ol kat.",
  "import-board-instruction-deck": "Putim kopi bilong bot JSON bilong NextCloud Deck (wanpela bot i gat \"stacks\", na wan wan stack i gat \"cards\" bilong en). Ol stack i kamap ol lis na ol kat i kamap ol kat.",
  "import-board-instruction-openproject": "Putim kopi bilong JSON bilong bung bilong ol wok long OpenProject (GET /api/v3/work_packages). Ol stetus i kamap ol lis na ol wok i kamap ol kat.",
  "import-board-instruction-issues": "Putim kopi bilong JSON array bilong ol isu long __sourceName__ (__endpoint__). Ol isu i kamap ol kat i bung long ol lis Open / Closed.",
  "import-board-instruction-asana": "Putim kopi bilong JSON bilong ol wok Asana ol i salim i go aut ({ \"data\": [...] } i kam long Asana o GET /tasks). Ol wok i bung long ol hap (memberships); ol wok i pinis i go long Done.",
  "import-board-instruction-zenkit": "Putim kopi bilong JSON bilong lis ZenKit ol i salim i go aut ({ \"title\", \"stages\":[...], \"items\":[...] }). Ol stage i kamap ol lis na ol item i kamap ol kat.",
  "import-board-instruction-trello": "Long bot Trello bilong yu, go long 'Menu', bihain 'More', 'Print and Export', 'Export JSON', na kisim kopi bilong rait i kamap.",
  "import-board-instruction-csv": "Putim kopi bilong ol veliu i gat koma namel long ol (CSV) o tab namel long ol (TSV).",
  "import-board-instruction-jira": "Putim kopi bilong JSON i kam long painim isu long Jira Cloud REST API (GET /rest/api/3/search/jql), o wanpela objek i wankain olsem { \"issues\": [...] }. Ol stetus bilong Jira i kamap ol lis na ol isu i kamap ol kat. Yu ken putim wanpela \"automationRules\" array tu bilong kisim ol rul i kam insait.",
  "import-board-instruction-excel": "Makim wanpela spredsit .xlsx i bihainim stail bilong WeKan (ol wankain kolum olsem taim yu salim i go aut long Excel: Title, Description, Status/List, Members, Labels, ol de na ol kastam fil). Fes lain i gat ol nem bilong kolum.",
  "import-excel-file": "Excel fail (.xlsx)",
  "import-board-instruction-wekan": "Long bot bilong yu, go long 'Menu', bihain 'Salim bot i go', na kisim kopi bilong rait insait long fail yu kisim i kam daun.",
  "import-board-instruction-about-errors": "Sapos yu kisim ol rong taim yu kisim bot i kam insait, sampela taim dispela wok i kamap gut yet, na bot i stap long pes bilong olgeta bot.",
  "import-without-mapping-members": "Kisim i kam insait na no linkim ol memba yet (linkim bihain)",
