  "import-trello-json-file-hint": "Wanpela bot Trello ol i salim i go aut olsem .json. Sapos yu seivim ki na token bilong Trello API pinis, ol fail i pas, piksa bilong bekgraun bilong bot na ol piksa bilong memba tu bai kam daun.",
