  "heading-notes": "Ol not",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Ol tok bilong helpim yu painim",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Yu ken yusim ol tok bilong bosim painim bilong mekim painim i stret moa. Raitim nem bilong tok na veliu, na putim kolon namel long tupela. Olsem, `lis:Blok` i painim ol kat insait long lis i gat nem *Blok* tasol. Sapos veliu i gat spes o ol narakain mak, putim insait long tupela mak bilong toktok (olsem `__operator_list__:\"Bilong Sekim\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Ol tok bilong bosim painim yu ken yusim:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - ol kat insait long ol bot i gat nem i wankain long *<title>* yu makim",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - ol kat insait long ol lis i gat nem i wankain long *<title>* yu makim",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - ol kat insait long ol rot bilong kat i gat nem i wankain long *<title>* yu makim",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - ol kat i gat koment i gat *<text>* insait long en.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - ol kat i gat mak i wankain long *<color>* o *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - sotpela rot bilong `__operator_label__:<color>` o `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - ol kat we *<username>* em *memba* o *man i kisim wok*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - sotpela rot bilong `yusa:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - ol kat we *<username>* em wanpela *memba*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - ol kat we *<username>* em *man i kisim wok*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - ol kat we *<username>* em man i bin mekim kat",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - ol kat bilong bot i stap long oganaisesen *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - ol kat bilong bot i stap long tim *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` - ol kat i mas pinis insait long *<n>* de stat long nau. `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__` i soim olgeta kat we taim bilong pinis i lus pinis.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - ol kat ol i bin mekim *<n>* de i go pinis o klostu moa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - ol kat ol i bin senisim *<n>* de i go pinis o klostu moa",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - *<status>* em wanpela bilong ol dispela:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - ol kat i stap long akaiv",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - olgeta kat i stap long akaiv na ol kat i no stap long akaiv",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - ol kat wantaim wanpela det bilong pinis",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - ol kat insait long ol bot bilong olgeta manmeri tasol",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - ol kat insait long ol praivet bot tasol",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - *<field>* em wanpela bilong `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` o `__predicate_member__`. Putim `-` long fran bilong *<field>* bilong painim ol kat i no gat veliu long dispela bokis (olsem `gat:-diu` i painim ol kat i no gat de wok i mas pinis).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - *<sort-name>* em wanpela bilong `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` o `__predicate_modified__`. Bilong oda i go daun, putim `-` long fran bilong nem bilong oda.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - *<n>* em namba i no gat hap na i bikpela moa long 0, i makim hamas kat bilong soim long wan wan pes.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Yu ken makim planti tok bilong bosim painim.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Ol tok bilong bosim painim i wankain i bung wantaim *O*. Ol kat i stret long wanpela bilong ol mak yu givim bai kamap.\n`__operator_list__:Redi __operator_list__:Blok` bai soim ol kat insait long ol lis i gat nem *Blok* o *Redi*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Ol narapela narapela tok bilong bosim painim i bung wantaim *NA*. Ol kat i stret long olgeta mak bilong ol dispela tok tasol bai kamap. `__operator_list__:Redi __operator_label__:ret` i soim ol kat insait long lis *Redi* i gat mak *ret* tasol.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Yu ken makim ol de olsem namba i no gat hap i gat plus o minus, o yusim `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` o `__predicate_year__` bilong hap taim bilong nau.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Painim teks i no skelim bikpela na liklik leta.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Long pasin bilong stat, painim i no painim ol kat long akaiv.",
