  "password-min-length-description": "Go insait wantaim sotpela paswot i stap long lis daunbilo. Ol i no save tambuim go insait long dispela as.",
  "password-min-length-enforce": "Strongim liklik longpela",
  "password-min-length-enforce-description": "Ol i no orait long nupela paswot i sotpela, na akaun i go insait wantaim sotpela paswot i mas senisim pastaim long mekim narapela samting. Senisim em i save putim olgeta sesen bilong akaun i go aut. Ol paswot bilong LDAP, OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, CAS na Sandstorm i bilong provaida bilong ol, na ol i no save sekim.",
  "password-change-required-text": "Dispela sait nau i laikim paswot i gat __min__ leta o moa, na bilong yu i sotpela. Makim wanpela longpela moa bilong go het. Bihain olgeta sesen bilong akaun bilong yu bai i go aut, na yu go insait gen wantaim nupela paswot.",
  "date-format-for-everyone": "Pasin bilong raitim det bilong olgeta",
  "calendar-system": "Sistem bilong kalenda (soim det)",
  "show-unread-changes": "Makim ol kat i senis bihain long taim mi opim ol las taim",
  "show-unread-changes-desc": "Wanpela kat we nem, stori, ol de, ol lebel, ol memba, ol seklis, ol samting i pas o ol tok bilong en i senis bihain long taim yu opim las taim bai kisim blupela arere long liklik kat bilong en, inap long yu opim.",
  "keep-title-tags": "Holim #mak na @memba long het tok bilong ol nupela kat",
  "keep-title-tags-description": "Taim yu makim wanpela mak wantaim # o wanpela memba wantaim @ taim yu raitim het tok bilong nupela kat, holim dispela tok long het tok tu. Op: mak o memba i kisim ples bilong dispela tok.",
  "show-focus-outline": "Soim aut-lain bilong fokus",
  "keep-add-card-form-open": "Larim fom bilong Putim kat i stap op bihain long putim kat",
  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "On: bihain long yu putim kat, fom i stap op wantaim nem i nogat samting long narapela kat. Of: fom i pas taim kat i go insait pinis.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Senisim [mak] long stat bilong het tok bilong nupela kat i kamap mak",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Taim het tok bilong nupela kat i stat long [Tok] na moa tok i kam bihain, Tok i kamap mak bilong kat (ol i wokim sapos bot i no gat mak long dispela nem) na ol i rausim long het tok. Op: het tok i stap olsem em i stap.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Seivim ol bokis bilong senisim wantaim Enter",
  "submit-on-enter-description": "Sapos dispela i wok, presim Enter bilong seivim nem na toksave bilong kat na ol arapela bokis bilong senisim long dispela pes; Shift+Enter i putim nupela lain. Sapos dispela i no wok, Ctrl/Cmd+Enter i seivim na Enter i putim nupela lain.",
  "open-many-cards-at-once": "Opim many ol kat long once",
  "open-many-cards-at-once-description": "Larim olgeta kat yu klikim i stap op long windo bilong em yet. Sapos dispela i no wok, taim yu klikim wanpela kat, kat i bin stap op bai pas.",
  "checklist-ding-sound": "Pilai wanpela nois taim wanpela samting long checklist i pinis",
  "checklist-ding-sound-description": "Pilai sotpela nois taim yu makim wanpela samting long lis bilong sekim olsem pinis. Long stat dispela i no wok.",
  "calendar-system-gregorian": "Kalenda Gregorian",
