  "label-text-overridden": "senisim pinis",
  "label-text-follows-board": "i bihainim seting bilong bot",
  "drag-to-reorder": "Pulim bilong senisim oda. Ol aro ki i go antap na daun i muv wanpela ples.",
  "ask-move-reason": "Muvim kat → Stori?",
  "draggable": "Yu inap pulim",
  "restore-card-wip-limit-reached": "Lis __list__ i kamap pinis long mak bilong WIP. Kisim bek kat i go long narapela lis:",
  "restore-card-no-list-with-room": "Olgeta lis long bod hia i kamap pinis long mak bilong WIP. Litimapim wanpela mak, o muvim o putim ol kat long stua, bilong kisim bek dispela kat.",
  "restore-all-skipped-wip-limit": "__count__ kat i no kam bek: ol lis bilong ol i kamap pinis long mak bilong WIP. Kisim bek ol wan wan bilong makim narapela lis.",
  "card-blocked": "I pas",
  "class-of-service": "Kain sevis",
  "moscow-priority": "Namba MoSCoW",
  "wsjf-score": "Skor WSJF",
  "board-announcement": "Toksave bilong bot",
  "board-announcement-enabled": "Soim long olgeta manmeri long dispela bot",
  "add-many-lines-as": "Putim planti lain olsem:",
  "many-items": "Planti __items__",
  "operator-number": "namba",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-number": "`__operator_number__:<number>` - ol kat i gat namba *<number>*",
  "subtask-inherit-parent-labels": "Kisim ol lebol bilong kaad papamama",
  "subtask-mark-done": "Makim liklik wok olsem i pinis",
  "subtask-mark-not-done": "Makim liklik wok olsem i no pinis",
  "subtask-done-no-permission": "Yu no inap senisim sapos dispela liklik wok i pinis o nogat",
  "board-view-calendar-mode": "Pasin bilong kalenda",
  "board-view-multiboard-cal": "Kalenda (Olgeta bot)",
  "wip-limit-groups": "Ol grup bilong mak bilong WIP",
  "wip-limit-group-name-placeholder": "Nem (yu ken makim)",
  "wip-limit-group-add": "Putim Larim i wok WIP Limit",
  "wip-limit-group-select-swimlane": "Makim bot Rot",
  "wip-limit-group-apply-swimlane": "Yusim long rot bilong kat",
  "board-view-time": "Taim",
  "time-adjustments": "Ol senis bilong taim long man i bin senisim",
  "time-adjustment-note": "Ol senis long ol aua i gat rekot, bungim long wan wan man i editim olgeta namba. Dispela i no ol wan wan taim bilong mekim wok. Ol veliu i gat minus em ol stretim. Taim bilong bipo i no gat rekot, yu no inap makim husat i mekim.",
  "auto-archive-days": "Putim ol kat long stua bihain long dispela hamas de i no gat senis",
  "auto-archive-off": "Pas",
  "auto-archive-hint": "Em i sekim olgeta aua. Taim wanpela kat i senis, em i kaun olsem kat i gat wok; em i no save putim ol templet long stua. Larim bokis i stap nating bilong stopim dispela.",
  "import-board-instruction-markdown": "Putim kopi bilong lis bilong wok long markdown (ol tul markdown-kanban olsem Obsidian Kanban i save yusim dispela pasin): ol het tok \"## Nem bilong lis\", wantaim ol samting \"- [ ]\"/\"- [x]\" aninit. Ol het tok i kamap ol lis na ol samting i kamap ol kat; lis i gat ol poin tasol na i no gat bokis bilong tikim tu i kam insait olsem ol kat i no pinis yet.",
  "import-board-instruction-opml": "Pestim wanpela OPML outline, olsem Workflowy, Dynalist, OmniOutliner, Logseq na ol narapela outliner i salim i go aut. Ol samting long antap tru i kamap ol lis, ol pikinini bilong ol i kamap ol kat wantaim not olsem stori, na ol samting i stap daun moa i kamap ol lis bilong sekim. Ol samting i pinis i kam insait olsem pinis.",
  "import-board-instruction-todotxt": "Putim kopi bilong fail todo.txt: wanpela wok long wanwan lain, olsem app todo.txt na ol app i wok wantaim em i save raitim. Ol wok i pinis (\"x\") i go long hap bilong ol wok i pinis, +project na @context i kamap ol lebol, (A) i kamap lebol bilong wok i mas kam pas, na due: na t: i kamap de bilong pinisim na de bilong statim wok.",
  "import-board-instruction-taskwarrior": "Putim autput bilong task export: wanpela JSON array o wanpela wok long olgeta lain. Ol wok i pinis i go long Done, project na priority i kamap ol mak, annotations i kamap ol komen, na depends i kamap ol samting i mas wetim ol wok i pasim rot.",
  "import-board-instruction-meistertask": "Long MeisterTask, klik long nem bilong projek, makim Export project na salim CSV i go aut, nau pestim. Ol hap i kamap ol lis na ol wok i kamap ol kat, wantaim ol not, de bilong pinisim, man i gat wok na ol tag bilong ol; ol wok i pinis i holim de ol i pinis. CSV ol i raitim bilong MeisterTask yet long bringim i kam em i wok tu.",
  "import-board-instruction-obsidian": "Long Obsidian, opim fail bilong Kanban bot olsem Markdown (o opim fail .md long wanpela edita bilong rait), nau pestim olgeta. Ol rot i kamap ol lis wantaim mak bilong hamas kat, ol kat i holim ol tag, de, samting i namba wan, fil na lis bilong sekim bilong ol, na Archive i kamap ol kat i stap long bokis bilong putim i stap.",
  "import-board-instruction-linear": "Long Linear, salim ol isyu i go aut olsem CSV (Settings, Import / Export, Export data, o export bilong wanpela view), nau pestim CSV. Ol stetas i kamap ol lis, ol tim i kamap ol rot, na ol isyu i kamap ol kat wantaim man i gat wok, ol mak, de, isyu papa, samting i namba wan, skelim, projek na saikol bilong ol.",
  "import-board-instruction-ticktick": "Long TickTick, opim Settings, Account, Backup & Import na wokim bekap, nau pestim fail CSV. Olgeta lis bilong TickTick i kamap wanpela rot na ol kolum bilong em i kamap ol lis; ol wok i holim ol tag, de, lis bilong sekim, samting i namba wan na ol liklik wok bilong ol.",
  "import-board-instruction-clickup": "Long ClickUp, salim ol wok i go aut olsem CSV (Settings, Imports / Exports, Export Items, o export bilong List o Table view wantaim olgeta kolum), nau pestim CSV. Ol stetas i kamap ol lis, ol lis bilong ClickUp i kamap ol rot, na ol wok i kamap ol kat wantaim ol liklik wok, ol man i gat wok, tag, de, samting i namba wan na taim bilong ol.",
  "import-board-instruction-nullboard": "Long Nullboard, opim bot, makim Export this board... long menyu, opim fail .nbx long wanpela edita bilong rait na pestim ol samting i stap insait. Ol lis i kamap ol lis na ol not i kamap ol kat: namba wan lain bilong not em i nem bilong kat na arapela hap em i stori. Wanpela raw not i kisim mak raw. Fail i gat planti bot i bringim namba wan bot tasol i kam.",
  "import-board-instruction-kanri": "Long Kanri, opim Import & Export na makim Export individual board (o Export all data), nau pestim fail .json. Ol kolum i kamap ol lis na ol kat i kamap ol kat, wantaim stori, de bilong pinisim, tag na kala bilong ol; ol wok bilong kat i kamap lis bilong sekim. Long export bilong olgeta data, namba wan bot i kam insait.",
  "import-board-instruction-pivotal": "Long Pivotal Tracker, opim tab MORE bilong projek na makim Export CSV (o makim ol stori na makim Bulk Actions, CSV), nau pestim CSV. Olgeta stetas bilong stori i kamap wanpela lis na ol stori i kamap ol kat, wantaim kain na ol mak, ol papa, man i askim, de, ol tok, ol wok na ol samting i pasim rot bilong ol; Estimate i kamap Story points na ol iteresen i kamap ol sprint.",
  "import-board-instruction-tasksorg": "Long Tasks.org, opim Settings, Backups na makim Export tasks, nau pestim ol samting i stap insait long fail .json. Ol lis i kamap ol lis na ol wok i kamap ol kat, wantaim ol not, tag, de, tok na ol liklik wok bilong ol; ol wok i pinis i holim de ol i pinis, na samting i namba wan i kamap fil bilong yu yet.",
  "import-board-instruction-monday": "Long monday.com, opim menyu bilong bot, makim More actions na Export board to Excel (wantaim ol nupela tok na ol liklik samting sapos yu laik), nau makim fail .xlsx. Kolum Status i kamap ol lis na ol grup i kamap ol rot; ol manmeri, de, lain bilong taim na tag i stap long ples bilong ol, ol arapela kolum i kamap ol fil bilong yu yet na ol nupela tok i kamap ol tok.",
  "import-board-instruction-superproductivity": "Long Super Productivity, opim Settings, nau Sync & Backup, makim Export Data na pestim ol samting i stap insait long fail sp-backup .json. Olgeta projek i kamap wanpela rot na ol wok i kamap ol kat long To Do, In Progress, Backlog o Done, wantaim ol not, tag, de bilong pinisim, taim ol i usim na ol liklik wok bilong ol; ol wok i stap long bokis bilong putim i stap i kamap ol kat i stap long bokis bilong putim i stap.",
  "import-board-instruction-quire": "Long Quire, opim menyu bilong projek na makim Export CSV, nau pestim CSV. Ol stetas i kamap ol lis na ol wok i kamap ol kat, wantaim ol liklik wok olsem pikinini kat, ol man i gat wok, tag olsem mak, de bilong stat, de bilong pinisim na de i pinis, stori na samting i namba wan olsem fil bilong yu yet. Ol tok na ol samting i pas i no stap long CSV bilong Quire.",
  "import-board-instruction-wrike": "Long Wrike, salim wanpela projek o folda i go aut long Excel, o pulimapim templet bilong Wrike long bringim Excel i kam, nau makim fail .xlsx. Ol lain bilong folda na projek i kamap ol rot, Status i kamap ol lis na ol wok i kamap ol kat, wantaim Key, wok papa, ol man i gat wok, de bilong stat na pinis, ol samting em i wetim na stori bilong ol; Priority, Duration na ol arapela kolum i kamap ol fil bilong yu yet.",
  "import-board-instruction-teamwork": "Long Teamwork.com, pulimapim templet bilong Excel long bringim wok i kam (Tasklist, Task, Description, Assign to, Start date, Due date, Priority, Estimated time, Tags, Status) na seivim olsem .xlsx, nau makim dispela fail. Ol lis bilong wok i kamap ol lis na ol wok i kamap ol kat; wok i stat long -, # o > i kamap liklik wok bilong wok i stap antap long em (--, ## o >> i go daun wanpela lain moa). Ol man i gat wok, de na tag i stap long ples bilong ol; Priority, Estimated time na Complete i kamap ol fil bilong yu yet.",
  "import-board-instruction-businessmap": "Long Businessmap (bipo nem Kanbanize), opim Advanced Search, makim Configure results long makim ol kolum, daunlodim fail Excel, nau makim fail .xlsx. Ol i ritim ol kolum long nem Inglis bilong ol (Title, Column, Lane, Owner, Deadline ...): sapos akaun bilong yu i usim narapela tok ples, senisim nem bilong lain het i go long Inglis pastaim. Column i kamap ol lis na Lane i kamap ol rot; ol papa, tag, kala, de, tok na link papa i stap long ples bilong ol, na Priority, Size, Type na ol arapela kolum i kamap ol fil bilong yu yet.",
  "import-board-instruction-redmine": "Long Redmine, opim Issues bilong projek, makim Also available in: CSV long as bilong lis, makim ol kolum (All columns, wantaim Description) na salim i go aut, nau pestim CSV. Redmine i kolim ol kolum long tok ples bilong yu, olsem na senisim tok ples bilong yu i go long Inglis long My account pastaim long salim i go aut. Olgeta stetas i kamap wanpela lis na ol isyu i kamap ol kat, wantaim tracker olsem mak, man i gat wok, man i raitim, de, wok papa na ol isyu i join; samting i namba wan, kategori, vesen yu laik kisim, taim yu ting, % Done na ol fil bilong yu yet i kamap ol fil bilong yu yet.",
  "import-board-instruction-orgmode": "Pestim wanpela fail bilong Org mode, olsem Emacs, Orgzly o Beorg i raitim. Ol het long antap tru i kamap ol lis na ol het long namba tu lain i kamap ol kat. TODO na DONE, ol samting i namba wan, ol tag, SCHEDULED, DEADLINE na CLOSED i stap, na ol bokis bilong sekim na ol het i stap daun moa i kamap ol lis bilong sekim.",
  "import-board-instruction-focalboard": "Opim fail .boardarchive i stap long zip na putim insait bilong board.jsonl bilong bod, wantaim lain bilong vesin o nogat. Seting bilong bungim ol samting long ol grup long bod i kamap ol lis, ol arapela seting bilong makim i kamap ol mak, ol hap teks na ol bokis bilong tikim i kamap tok save na lis bilong sekim, na ol komen i stap yet. Ol piksa na ol fail i pas wantaim i no kam insait."
}